{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Hey Peter, any luck with that speed dating? Have you met your other half yet?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Very funny. That must feel natural for you, but not for me. I wish I were as successful with girls as you are. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        It doesn't always work out, you know.   For example, there was this girl I really liked. We hit it off immediately and had a lot of fun on the first date. I thought we matched up pretty well. I could have fallen for her, but in the end I realized that she was leading me on.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I know the feeling! I fell head over heels for a girl who was into comics and movies like me, but our date didn't go anywhere. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        That may not have been easy for you. I know how much you like your superheroes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I wish she liked me, too, besides Batman and Superman.", "id": 2, "time": "34000", "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Don't worry about her. There must be someone who's right for you out there!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I just wish I was less awkward when I talk to someone I don't know. It can't be hard for you. You ask girls out all the time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Keep trying. If you have good chemistry with someone, you'll know straightaway.", "id": 3, "time": "52000", "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le11ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7